    {
      "name": "FAQ Accordion Item",
      "role": "Expandable question/answer in the FAQ section",
      "description": "Transparent background, no border between items, just vertical spacing. Question text in Paper (#e5e7eb) 18px Inter weight 500 with a 16px circular + icon on the right (Iron border, 1px stroke). Open state reveals answer text in Smoke (#a0a0a0) 16px. Clean, no box, no card."
