      "role": "CLI install command display",
      "description": "Carbon (#1f1f1c) background, 8px radius, 16px 24px padding. $ prompt in Electric Lime, command text in Paper (#e5e7eb) using Inconsolata 16px weight 600. Copy icon on the right edge. The one moment a different typeface enters the system — immediately signals 'developer content'."
