      "name": "Hero Section",
      "role": "Above-the-fold value proposition",
      "description": "Void Black background, full-width. Centered 96px Inter weight 900 headline in Paper, with the brand name 'ClickHouse' highlighted in Electric Lime via the brand gradient. 18px subtext in Bone. Two-button stack (primary + ghost) with 12px gap. Generous 120-160px vertical padding. No hero image, no background graphic."
